The first task was reference scouting: 8–12 underrated personal sites from Reddit, Behance, Figma Community, X threads, godly.website, minimal.gallery, and dark.design, avoiding famous defaults such as Brittany Chiang, Bruno Simon, and typical Awwwards winners. Outputs are preserved in:

